    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.63720703125,
        527.4354858398438,
        399.0802307128906
      ],
      "text": "February 2021, as well as the references of 17 related reviews. 3265 abstracts from databases and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.83721923828125,
        527.6205444335938,
        412.2802429199219
      ],
      "text": "129 additional references from related reviews were identified and assessed. 516 full-text articles were",
