      "size": 10.978379249572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.0372009277344,
        527.4376220703125,
        425.480224609375
      ],
      "text": "assessed for eligibility, from which 25 comparative studies (7 randomized, 18 observational) were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.2372131347656,
        527.5948486328125,
        438.68023681640625
      ],
      "text": "identified; one unpublished observational study was added making a total of 26 studies. Four studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996899604797363,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.43719482421875,
        527.6135864257812,
        451.8802185058594
      ],
      "text": "(one randomized, three observational) were excluded after review because the care model described",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
