      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.83721923828125,
        527.617919921875,
        478.2802429199219
      ],
      "text": "the remaining included studies, 16 had elements of decentralization, five had elements of integration,",
