      "size": 10.984589576721191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.0372009277344,
        527.412353515625,
        491.480224609375
      ],
      "text": "and three had elements of family-centred care; four studies had elements of more than one care",
