      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.2372131347656,
        527.4530029296875,
        504.68023681640625
      ],
      "text": "model of interest, but were only included based on their main model, such as either decentralization",
