    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.43719482421875,
        465.3800964355469,
        517.8801879882812
      ],
      "text": "or family-centred, integrated care. Most studies focused on the 0–14-year age group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.14111328125,
        527.36181640625,
        539.5841064453125
      ],
      "text": "Studies where the primary intervention was decentralization mostly assessed diagnosis or case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.5470581054688,
        527.4215698242188,
        552.7840576171875
      ],
      "text": "(48, 101–115) (106, 116, 117) notification outcomes (n=16)  , with fewer assessing TPT outcomes (n=3)  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.5411376953125,
        527.59375,
        565.984130859375
      ],
      "text": "In general, interventions that included both strengthening of diagnostic capacity in primary care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.7410888671875,
        527.4035034179688,
        579.18408203125
      ],
      "text": "settings as well as strengthening linkages between communities and facilities consistently showed an",
