      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.9411010742188,
        524.4104614257812,
        592.3840942382812
      ],
      "text": "increase in case notifications and TPT initiations, while interventions that involved only community-",
