      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.14111328125,
        181.26211547851562,
        605.5841064453125
      ],
      "text": "based activities did not.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.0509643554688,
        527.4227905273438,
        627.2879638671875
      ],
      "text": "(118, 119) Two studies of service integration were identified  , which showed limited impact on case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.0450439453125,
        527.4619140625,
        640.488037109375
      ],
      "text": "notifications of screening in IMCI clinics or co-location of TB and ART services. The two studies of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.4511108398438,
        527.4273071289062,
        653.6881103515625
      ],
      "text": "(120, 121) family-centred care that were identified   showed that provision of socioeconomic support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.445068359375,
        510.8769836425781,
        666.8880615234375
      ],
      "text": "packages to families affected by TB was associated with increased TPT initiation and completion.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.1489868164062,
        527.4168701171875,
        688.5919799804688
      ],
      "text": "The reviewers noted that, while substantial wider literature on integration and family-centred care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
